-- Sale of Food Act 1973 — INDEPENDENT TESTS.
-- Expected values are those fixed in independent-expectations.md (E-numbers),
-- written from the source before the encoding was read. They are not changed
-- to match the encoding.

§ `Independent tests`

§§ `Helpers`

GIVEN consumed IS A BOOLEAN
      gum IS A BOOLEAN
      declared IS A BOOLEAN
      ex IS AN `Excluded product`
GIVETH AN Article
`thing` consumed gum declared ex MEANS Article OF consumed, FALSE, gum, declared, ex, FALSE

GIVEN handles IS A BOOLEAN
      excluded IS A BOOLEAN
      retail IS A BOOLEAN
      component IS A BOOLEAN
      primary IS A BOOLEAN
      licensed IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Business facts`
`biz` handles excluded retail component primary licensed MEANS `Business facts` OF handles, excluded, retail, component, primary, licensed

GIVEN reliance IS A BOOLEAN
      noreason IS A BOOLEAN
      conformed IS A BOOLEAN
      abroad IS A BOOLEAN
      believed IS A BOOLEAN
      prosecutor IS A MAYBE DATE
      warrantor IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Warranty facts`
`wty` reliance noreason conformed abroad believed prosecutor warrantor MEANS
    `Warranty facts` OF reliance, noreason, conformed, abroad, believed, (YMD 2026 3 1), prosecutor, warrantor

`good warranty` MEANS `wty` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 8)) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 8))

GIVEN a IS AN Article
      c IS A Conduct
      repeat IS A BOOLEAN
      steps IS A BOOLEAN
      w IS A MAYBE `Warranty facts`
GIVETH A `Food case`
`fcase` a c repeat steps w MEANS `Food case` OF a, c, repeat, steps, w, TRUE

`cooked rice` MEANS `thing` TRUE FALSE FALSE `none`

GIVEN m IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the cap` m s IF
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN JUST x  THEN s AT MOST x
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

GIVEN c IS A Conduct
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `breach` c IF `the conduct contravenes the Act` c

